hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
2736,"Hadees ka tarjuma:\n\nHazrat Ali (razi Allahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Ek Musalman par doosre Musalman ke haq mein aadaab chhe hain: Jab usse milay to usse Salaam dena.\"""""
2737,"Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Momin par doosre momin ke zimme cheezein hain: Jab woh bimaar ho to usay ziyarat karna.\"""""
2738,"# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\n**Qutaybah ne hamari taraf riwayat ki, Sufyān ibn ʿUyaynah ne riwayat ki, ʿAmr ibn Dīnār se, Wahb ibn Munabbih se, uske bhai se — aur woh Hammām ibn Munabbih hain — jisne farmāyā:**\n\n\Main ne Abū Hurayrah (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhū) se sunā", woh farmāte the: 'Rasūlullāh (Ṣallallāhu ʿAlayhi wa Sallam) ke ṣaḥābah mein se koi shakhs mujh se zyāda Rasūlullāh (Ṣallallāhu ʿAlayhi wa Sallam) se hadīṡ riwayat nahin kartā thā, sivā ʿAbdullāh ibn ʿAmr (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhū) ke, kyunke woh likhte the," jabke main nahin likhtā thā.'\""\n\nAbū ʿĪsā (Tirmiz̤ī) ne farmāyā: \""Yeh *hasan sahīh* hadīṡ hai. Aur Wahb ibn Munabbih ne apne bhai Hammām ibn Munabbih se riwayat ki.\""\n\n---\n\n**Tawz̤īh:** Yeh riwayat Abū Hurayrah (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhū) ke ʿaz̤īm ḥāfiz̤ah ko numāyāṡ karti hain", jinhone Rasūlullāh (Ṣallallāhu ʿAlayhi wa Sallam) se be-ḥisāb ahadīṡ ko likhne ke baghair hifz̤ karke riwayat ki," jabke ʿAbdullāh ibn ʿAmr (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhū) ne apne ḥāfiz̤ah ko tahrīrī tadwīn se mazīd maz̤būṭ kiyā thā."""
2739,"Abu Musa (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya ke: \nYahoodiyon ke aadat thi ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ki huzoor mein chheenk marte taake unhe yeh du'a mil jaye: \Yarhamukumullah (Allah tum par rahmat kare).\"" \nIsliye Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \""Yahdikumullahu wa yuslihu balakum (Allah tumhe hidayat de aur tumhare umoor theek kare).\"""""
2740,Salim bin Ubaid ne riwayat kiya ke woh kuch logon ke saafar the.
2741,"Abu Ayyub (Razi Allah Anho) rivayat karte hain ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se koi aaye to usse karein: 'Al-Hamdulillahi 'Ala Kulli Hal (Har haal mein sab hamd Allah ke liye hai).' Aur jo jawab de usse karein: 'Yarhamukallah (Allah tum par rahmat karein).' Aur usse karein: 'Yahdikumullah Wa Yuslihu Balakum (Allah tumhe hidayat de aur tumhare mamalat theek karein).'\"""""
2742,"Hazrat Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hain ki do aadmiyan Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ki huzoor mein aachhi kar di aur un mein se ek ki aachhi ka unhon ne jawab diya, lekin doosri ki aachhi ka jawab nahi diya. Jis aadmi ki aachhi ka jawab nahi gaya, us ne kaha: \Ya Rasool Allah (ﷺ)! Tum ne is aadmi ki aachhi ka jawab diya"," lekin meri aachhi ka jawab nahi diya?\"" Tab Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne farmaaya: \""Is ne Allah Ta'ala ki hamd aur tasbih ka zikr kiya"," jabke tum ne Allah ki hamd nahi ki.\"""""
2743,"Iyas bin Salamah ki rivayat hai, unke father (ﷺ) se: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ki dargah mein ek aadmi ne aansoo (chheenk) ki"," jabki main maujood tha.\"""""
2744,Abu Hurairah (radhiyallahu 'anhu) ne riwayat farmaya ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Jis shakhs ne hidayat ki taraf da'wat diya, uske liye un logon ke ajr ka ajr milega jo uski pairwi karte hain, isse unke ajr mein kuch kami nahi hogi. Aur jis shakhs ne gumraahi ki taraf da'wat diya, us par un logon ke gunaah ka gunaah lagega jo uski pairwi karte hain," isse unke gunaahon mein kuch kami nahi hogi.\""\n\nAbu Isa (Tirmizi) ne kaha: Yeh hadith hasan sahih hai."""
2745,"Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko jab chheenk aati thi to apney haath sey ya apney kapdey sey munh dhanp letey, aur apni aawaz ko dheemi kartey. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
2746,Abu Horaira (raziyallahu anhu) rivayat karte hain ki Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Chakh (aksar) Allah ki taraf se hai aur jaag (yawn) Ash-Shaitan ki taraf se. Pas jab tum mein se kisi ko jaag aaye," to usne apni mooh apni haath se dhaanp le. Kyunki jab woh 'Ah' kahe to Ash-Shaitan us par hans kararta hai.\"""""
2747,Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Beshak Allah Ta'ala ki hansana ko pasand farmata hai aur usko qaih (jama' qaih) se nafrat hai. Pas jab tum mein se koi hansaye aur 'Al-Hamdulillah' (sab tareef Allah hi ke liye hai) kahe,"2748""","Abu Yaqzan ne riwayat ki, 'Adi se — aur woh Ibn Thabit hain — uske walid se."
2749,Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Kisi ek tumhare bhai ko uski jagah se mat utaaro," phir khud us mein baith jao.\"""""
2750,"Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Koi tum mein se apne bhai ki jagah se usay khada na karke phir khud us mein baith jaye.\"""""
2751,"Wahb bin Hudaifah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Aik aadmi ko apni jagah ka zyada haq hai. Agar woh apni kisi zaroorat se chala jaye to...\"""""
2752,**Urdu Translation (Roman Script):**\n\nAbdullah bin Amr (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Kisi aadmi ke liye yeh jaiz nahi hai ke do afraad ke darmiyan, unke ijazat ke baghair," fasla (judai) paida kare.\"""""
2753,"Abu Miljaz ne riwayat ki ke ek aadmi ek halqa ke darmiyan baith gaya. Toh Hudhaifah (رضي الله عنه) ne farmaya: \Muhammad (صلی اللہ علیہ"""
2754,"Hadees ka tarjuma:\n\nHazrat Anas (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: \an kay nzdyk kwyy shkhs rswl allh ﷺ say zyadh mhbwb nhyn tha۔\"" (anhwn nay kha:) \""awr jb wh aap ﷺ kw dykhtay tw khray nhyn hwtay thay، kywnkh wh jantay thay kh aap ﷺ asay napsnd frmatay hyn۔\"""""
2755,Abu Miljaz ne riwayat ki ke Mu'awiyah (radi Allahu anho) nikle aur Abdullah bin Az-Zubair aur Ibn Safwan ne unke liye khade ho gaye jab unhone unhe dekha.
2756,"Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Paanch cheezein Fitrah se hain: Pubic baal kaatna.\"""""
2757,"Hazrat Aishah (Razi Allahu Anha) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Dus (aadat) Fitrah se hain: Moonchh ka chhota karna.\"""""
2758,Abu Hurairah (radiyAllahu 'anhu) rivayat karte hain ke Rasoolullah (sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Us Zaat ki Qasam jis ke Haath mein meri jaan hai, tum Jannat mein tabhi dakhil nahi ho sakte jab tak iman na lao," aur tum haqeeqat mein momin tabhi nahi ho sakte jab tum ek dusre ke liye mohabbat na karo. Kya tumhe aisi amal ki hidaayat na karoon jo agar tum ne amal kiya to tum ek dusre se mohabbat karne lago? Ek dusre ke darmiyaan as-salam phelao.\""\n\nYeh hadith Abdullah ibn Salam", Shurayh ibn Hani apne walid ki risalat se, Abdullah ibn Amr, al-Bara," Anas aur Ibn Umar (radiyAllahu 'anhum ajma'in) se bhi manqool hai.\n\nAbu Isa (rahimahullah) ne kaha: Yeh hasan sahih hadith hai."""
2759,"Hazrat Anas bin Malik (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: \rswl allh ﷺ nay hmaray lyay mwnhyn trashnay ka wqt mqrr frmaya۔\"""""
2760,"# Hadīth kā Tarjumah (ʿIlmī Urdū mein)\n\n**Abū Sa'īd (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhu) se riwāyat hai:**\n\nAbū Mūsā (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhu) ne ʿUmar (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhu) ke hāẓirī kī ijāzat māṅgī. Unhoṅ ne kahā: \As-salāmu ʿalaykum — kyā maiṅ andar ā'ūṅ?\"" ʿUmar (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhu) ne farmāyā: \""Yeh ek bār hai.\"" Phir kuch der sukūn se ruk gaye aur dubārā kahā: \""As-salāmu ʿalaykum — kyā maiṅ andar ā'ūṅ?\"" ʿUmar ne farmāyā: \""Yeh do bār hai.\"" Phir kuch der sukūn se ruk gaye aur kahā: \""As-salāmu ʿalaykum — kyā maiṅ andar ā'ūṅ?\"" ʿUmar ne farmāyā: \""Yeh tīn bār hai.\"" Phir Abū Mūsā (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhu) muṛ kar wāpas chalē ga'e. ʿUmar ne darbān se pūchhā: \""Unhoṅ ne kyā kiyā?\"" Usne jawāb diyā: \""Woh wāpas chalē ga'e.\"" ʿUmar ne farmāyā: \""Use mere pās lāo.\"" Jab woh ā'e"," ʿUmar ne pūchhā: \""Yeh kyā kiyā tum ne?\"" Unhoṅ ne kahā: \""Yeh to Sunnat hai.\"" ʿUmar ne farmāyā: \""Sunnat? Wallāh", tum is kā dalīl yā burhān zarūr lāo," nahīṅ to maiṅ tumheṅ sazā dūṅgā.\""\n\nAbū Sa'īd (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhu) ne kahā: \""Woh hamāre pās ā'e jab ham Anṣār kī ek jamāʿat the aur kahā: 'A'e majlis-e Anṣār! Kyā tum log Rasūlullāh (Ṣallallāhu ʿAlayhi wa Sallam) ke ahādīth se sab zyādā wāqif nahīṅ? Kyā Rasūlullāh (Ṣallallāhu ʿAlayhi wa Sallam) ne nahīṅ farmāyā thā: **\""Ijāzat māṅgnā (al-isti'dhān) tīn bār hai. Agar tumheṅ ijāzat dī ga'ī to andar ā jāo"," aur nahīṅ to wāpas jāo\""**?'\"" Log us par halkī-bahalkī bātēṅ karnē lagē. Abū Sa'īd (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhu) ne kahā: \""Phir maiṅ ne us kī taraf sir uṭhāyā aur kahā: 'Jis qism kī sazā tumhēṅ is māmle meṅ hu'ī hai"," us meṅ bhī merā hissādar hai.'\"" Unhoṅ ne kahā: \""Phir woh ʿUmar (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhu) ke pās ga'e aur unheṅ is kī ittilāʿ dī"," aur ʿUmar ne farmāyā: 'Mujhe is kā ilm nahīṅ thā.'\""\n\n**Is bāb mein ʿAlī (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhu) aur Umm Tāriq", Sa'd kī āzād shudah bīvī, se bhī riwāyāt haiṅ.**\n\nAbū ʿĪsā (Tirmiz̤ī," Rahimahullāh) ne farmāyā: \""Yeh hadīth hasan sahīh hai. Jurayrī kā nām Sa'īd ibn Iyās hai aur unkī kunyat Abū Mas'ūd hai. Dūsre bhī log Abū Nadrah se yeh riwāyat karte haiṅ. Abū Nadrah ʿAbdī kā nām al-Mundhir ibn Māliq ibn Qut'ah hai.\"""""
2761,"Zaid bin Arqam (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \js nay apny mwnchh say nhyn lya...\"""""
2762,# Hadith ka Tarjama\n\n**Abu Hurayrah (radiyAllahu 'anhu) rivayat karte hain:**\n\nEk shakhs masjid mein dakhil hai jabke Rasoolullah (sallAllahu 'alayhi wa sallam) masjid ke ek kone mein baithe the. Us shakhs ne namaz ada phir aake unhe salam pher diya. Rasoolullah (sallAllahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: **\Wa 'alaykum. Wapas jao aur namaz padho," tum ne namaz nahi padhi.\""**\n\nPhir hadith poori rivayah ki gayi.\n\n**Abu Isa (al-Tirmidhi) ne kaha:** Yeh **hasan** hadith hai.\n\nYahya ibn Sa'id al-Qattan ne yeh 'Ubayd Allah ibn 'Umar se", woh Sa'id al-Maqburi se riwayat kiya," aur unhone kaha: **\""Apne father se", Abu Hurayrah se,"\""** aur is mein **\""phir unhone salam pher diya\""** ka zikr nahi kiya"," aur unhone kaha: **\""Wa 'alaykum.\""**\n\nUnhone (Abu Isa) kaha: **Yahya ibn Sa'id ki hadith zyada sahih hai.**\n\n---\n\n*Ehsaas: Yeh mashhoor hadith us shakhs ki hai jis ne usool-e-namaz se ghalti ki", jis par Nabi ﷺ ne us ko namaz dobara ada karne ka hukum diya," aur usme Nabi ﷺ ne us ko namaz ke sahi tarika sikhaya.*"""
2763,"Hazrat Ibn 'Umar (rzy allh anhma) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \mwndhy kw chhwta krw awr darhy kw brhnay dw۔\"""""
2764,Ibn Umar (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay mwnchhyn ktrnay ka awr darhy brhanay ka hkm frmaya۔
2765,"Qutaybah ne ham se riwayat ki, Ibn Luḥayʿah ne ham se riwayat ki, ʿAmr ibn Shuʿayb ne apne baap se riwayat ki, aur unke baap ne apne dada se riwayat ki, aur unke dada ne Rasool Allah ﷺ se riwayat ki ke Aap ﷺ ne farmaya:\n\n\Woh ham mein se nahi jo doosron ki tashabbuh kare. Yahoodiyon aur Nasaron ki tashabbuh na karo", kyunke Yahoodiyon ka salam ungliyon ka ishara hai," aur Nasaron ka salam hatheliyon ka ishara hai.\""\n\nAbū ʿĪsā ne farmaya: Is hadith ki sanad zaif hai. Aur Ibn al-Mubārak ne yeh hadith Ibn Luḥayʿah se riwayat ki hai lekin ise marfoo (ya'ni Rasool Allah ﷺ tak) nahi pahunchaya."""
2766,"Jabir (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat kiya: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Ishtimal As-Samma (kapde ko sirf ek taraf se lapet kar pehne) se mana farmaya.\"""""
2767,"Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Ishtimal As-Samma (kapron ko sir se lekar pair tak ek taraf se lapet kar pehne ki) se mana farmaya.\"""""
2768,"Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne ek aadmi ko apne pet par pada dekha, to farmaya: \Beshak yeh tariqa Allah ko pasand nahi hai.\"""""
2769,Baz bin Hakim ne riwayat ki ke mere baap ne mere dada se riwayat ki.
2770,Jabir bin Samurah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay:\n\nmyn nay rswl allh ﷺ kw ayk tkyh ya balsh pr tyk lga kr jhkay hwyay dykha۔
2771,Jabir bin Samurah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay:\n\nmyn nay nby krym (ﷺ) kw tkyh lga kr tyk lgayay hwyay dykha۔
2772,"Abu Mas'ud (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \ksy shkhs kw as kay aqtdar myn amamt nhyn ky ja skty۔\"""""
2773,"Abdullah bin Buraidah ne riwayat ki: \Main ne apne walid Buraidah ko kehte suna: 'Main Nabi (ﷺ) ke saath chal raha tha ke ek aadmi ek gadha lekar aaya...'\"""""
2774,"Jabir (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \kya tmharay pas anmt (kpray) hyn؟\"" myn nay kha: \""hmyn anmt khan say mlyn gay؟\"" aap (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \""jld hy tmharay pas anmt hwn gay۔\"" jabr (rz all an) nay kha: \""myn apny bywy say khta: 'apnay kpray myry nzr say hta dw۔' wh khty: 'kya rswl allh (ﷺ) nay nhyn frmaya tha kh jld hy tmharay pas anmt hwn gay؟'\"" anhwn nay kha: \""tw myn nay asay chhwr dya۔\"""""
2775,"Iyaas bin Salamah ne apni taraf se riwaayat ki, aur unke baap ne farmaya ke: \Main ne Allah ke Nabi (ﷺ) aur Hasan aur Husain (رضي الله عنهم) ko sawaar ki.\"""""
2776,Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne rivayat kiya ke maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) se be-ghalat nazar (unintentional glance) ke bare mein poocha.
2777,"Ibn Buraidah ne apni taraf se riwayat ki, jo apne baap se rawaiyya ke zariye Nabi Kareem ﷺ se naql farmate hain ke: \Ya Ali! Ek nazar ke baad doosri nazar mat karo.\"""""
2778,"Nabhan, Umm Salamah ke azaad karda ghulaam ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat ki:"
2779,"Dhakwan ne riwayat ki, jo Amr bin Al-'As ki laundi thi, ke Amr bin Al-'As ne unhein Ali (radi Allahu anhu) ke paas bheja ke un se Asma bint Umais (radi Allahu anha) ke paas dakhil hone ki ijazat maangein."
2780,"Sufyān ibn Wakīʿ ne rawāyat kī, Rawḥ ibn ʿUbādah ne rawāyat kī, Ibn Jurayj se, ʿAmr ibn Abī Sufyān ne mujhe ittilāʿ dī ki ʿAmr ibn ʿAbdullāh ibn Ṣafwān ne mujhe ittilāʿ dī ki Kaladah ibn Ḥanbal ne mujhe ittilāṉ dī ki Ṣafwān ibn Umayyah ne mujhe doodh, chote ūṅṭ ke gosht aur *ḍaghābīs* ke sath Nabī ﷺ ke pās bhejā, jabki Nabī ﷺ wādī ke ūparī hissé meṉ the. Kaladah ne kahā: \Main un ke pās salām bheje baghair aur ijāzat māṅge baghair dākhil ho gayā. Nabī ﷺ ne farmayā: 'Wapas jāo aur kaho: *As-salāmu ʿalaykum", may I enter?*' Yeh Ṣafwān ke Islām lāne ke bād thā.' ʿAmr ne kahā: 'Umayyah ibn Ṣafwān ne bhī yeh hadīs mujhe sunāī," lekin unhone nahīṉ kahā ki maine Kaladah se sunī.' Abū ʿĪsā ne kahā: 'Yeh ek *ḥasan gharīb* hadīs hai; hum ise Ibn Jurayj kī hadīs ke siwā kahīṉ nahīṉ jānte. Abū ʿĀṣim ne bhī Ibn Jurayj se isī tarah rawāyat kī. *Ḍaghābīs* ek qism kī khāne lāiyq jadī bootī hai.'\"""""
2781,**Humaid bin Abdur-Rahman ne riwayat ki ke unhon ne Muawiyah (رضي الله عنه) ko Madina Munawwara mein khutba detay huay suna.**
2782,**Hazrat Abdullah (R.A.) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne woh auraton par la'nat bhejti hain jo khud ko ghaleez nishaan (tattoo) karwati hain aur jo ghaleez nishaan karwati hain.**
2783,"Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Allah Ta'ala ki laanat hai us par jis apna baal lambi karti hai aur us par jis apne baal lambwaati hain.\"""""
2784,"Ibn 'Abbas (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay: \rswl allh ﷺ nay an awrtwn pr lant bhyjy jw mrdwn ky nql krty hyn awr an mrdwn pr lant bhyjy jw awrtwn ky nql krtay hyn۔\"""""
2785,"Ibn 'Abbas (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay: \rswl allh ﷺ nay an mrdwn pr lant bhyjy jw awrtwn jysay bn jatay hyn awr an awrtwn pr bhy jn ka chal chln mrdwn jysa hw۔\"""""
2786,"Abu Musa (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \hr aankh zna krty hay۔\"""""
2787,"Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Mard ke liye khushboo woh hai jiski khushboo zaahir ho aur uska rang chhupa ho.\"""""
2788,"Imran bin Husain (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \bay shk mrdwn kay lyay bhtryn khwshbw wh hay js ky khwshbw zahr hw awr as ka rng pwshydh hw۔\"""""
2789,Thumamah bin Abdullah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya ke: Anas (رضي الله عنه) khushboo ko kabhi inkar nahi karte the.
2790,"Ibn 'Umar (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \tyn chyzyn aysy hyn jw rd nhyn ky jatyn: tkyay...\"""""
2791,"Abu 'Uthman An-Nahdi (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai: Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se kisi ko khusboo (khushbu) di jaye to use na karne na kiyo.\"""""
2792,"Abdullah (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat kiye ki Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Aurat ko kisi aur aurat ko is tarah chhuna nahi chahiye ke woh uske shohar ko us aurat ka is tarah bayan kar sake jaise ke woh usay dekh raha ho.\"""""
2793,"Hazrat Abdur-Rahman bin Abi Sa'eed (Khudri) (rz all anh) nay apnay bap say rwayt ky hay kh anhwn nay frmaya:\n\n\rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: 'ksy mrd kw ksy dwsray mrd ky awrt (awrt ka hsh) dykhnay ky ajazt nhyn hay۔'\"""""
2794,"# Masjid Mein Dakhil Honay Walay Teen Ādmī Kā Hadīth\n\n**Abū Wāqid al-Laithī (Raziyallāhu Anhu) se riwāyat hai:**\n\nRasūlullāh (ﷺ) ek dafa masjid mein apne ḥuzūr mein baithay huay thay aur Ṣaḥābah (Raziyallāhu Anhum) ḥalqe mein mojūd thay. Ān par teen ādmī ā gayay. Un mein se do Rasūlullāh (ﷺ) ke ḥuzūr mein ā gayay aur unhe salām kiyā, jabke teesrā wāpis chalā gayā aur ruk gayā.\n\nUn do ādmīyon mein se awwal ne ḥalqe mein ek jagah khālī dekhī aur us mein baith gayā. Dūsrā unke pīchay baith gayā. Teesrā wāpis muṛ gayā aur chalā gayā.\n\nJab Rasūlullāh (ﷺ) ne (muqarrar kaam) pūrā kiyā, to farmāyā:\n\n**\Kiyā tumhe batāūn tīn ādmīyon ke bāre mein? Un mein se ek ne Allāh se panāh māngī", to Allāh ne usse panāh dī. Dūsre ne ḥayā (sharam-o-ḥayā) kī, to Allāh ne us par ḥayā (raḥmat) kī. Teesre ne muṛ gayā," to Allāh ne bhi usse muṛ gayā.\""**\n\n---\n\n**Abū Īsā (Tirmidhī", Rahimahullāh) ne kahā:** Ye *ḥasan ṣaḥīḥ* hadīth hai.\n\n**Ruwāt ke bāre mein tawḍīḥ:**\n\n- **Abū Wāqid al-Laithī** (Raziyallāhu Anhu) — unka nām al-Ḥārith bin ʿAwf hai.\n- **Abū Murrah**," Umm Hānī bint Abī Ṭālib (Raziyallāhu Anhā) kī mawlā se — unka nām Yazīd hai. Unhe ʿAqīl bin Abī Ṭālib (Raziyallāhu Anhu) kī mawlā bhi kahā jātā hai.\n\n---\n\n*Jāmiʿ al-Tirmidhī mein marfūʿ hai.*"""
2795,"Zur'ah bin Muslim bin Jardah Al-Aslami ne riwayat kiya, uske dada Jarhad (radiyallahu anhu) ke zarye':"
